
# 2025-11-24 11:25:43.574402
+Code the following app
+```
+Requirements:
+- 10x10 grid
+- Blocks fill grid squares
+- Player receives 3 random block shapes each round
+- Shapes include: 1x1, 1x2, 1x3, 2x2 square, L-shape, T-shape, 4x1 bar
+- Player drags shapes onto the grid; shape must fit entirely
+- When a row or column is fully filled, clear it and increase the score
+- Scoring: 1 point per block placed, +10 per cleared row/column, +5 combo
+- If no available shape can be placed anywhere on the grid, show "Game Over"
+- Include: score display, reset button, clean and minimal UI
+- Use simple colors, flat design, no animations
+- Code must be compact and optimized for a mini-app
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

